# Parallel fan-out

```elixir
Mix.install([{:elixir_harness, path: "."}])
```

`Task.async_stream` with backpressure; one crasher can't fail the batch.

```elixir
tasks = for i <- 1..8, do: {ElixirHarness.Tools.Math, %{"op" => "add", "a" => i, "b" => 0}}
ElixirHarness.Orchestrator.fan_out(tasks, max_concurrency: 8) |> IO.inspect()
```

Workers are `GenServer`s under a `DynamicSupervisor`, found via
`Registry`, grouped with `:pg` — all OTP built-ins, no Redis, no queue.
